    "title_en": "NIH launches new office to advance human-based research and reduce animal use",
    "sub": "New office will coordinate efforts to develop, validate and scale animal-free research models.",
    "sub_pt": "New office will coordinate efforts to develop, validate and scale animal-free research models.",
